{
  "evidenceCount": 12,
  "evidenceSpans": [
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-fd01c7a0",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0003",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法适用于银行为国内企事业单位之间货物和服务贸易提供的信用证服务。服务贸易包括但不限于运输、旅游、咨询、通讯、建筑、保险、金融、计算机和信息、专有权利使用和特许、广告宣传、电影音像等服务项目。",
      "quoteHash": "fd01c7a031522376b4e96e22b8cd9106ec7f89e0d1066fe24b60a689de8ef16a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-41f5f699",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0004",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "信用证业务的各方当事人应当遵守中华人民共和国的法律、法规以及本办法的规定，遵守诚实信用原则，认真履行义务，不得利用信用证进行欺诈等违法犯罪活动，不得损害社会公共利益。",
      "quoteHash": "41f5f69976dbd45cbcfc26acf5f1476a47d0516aadbac0e694b37981dd2f0a2f",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-10c32bc8",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0027",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "对于可转让信用证，开证行必须指定转让行，转让行可为开证行。转让行无办理信用证转让的义务，除非其明确同意。转让行仅办理转让，并不承担信用证项下的付款责任，但转让行是保兑行或开证行的除外。",
      "quoteHash": "10c32bc8945021cdc1cede82b5d7674040b88568e3b248c2a42f4da3ee1dde2d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-02fd331d",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0033",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "第一受益人的任何转让要求须说明是否允许以及在何条件下允许将修改通知第二受益人。已转让信用证须明确说明该项条款。",
      "quoteHash": "02fd331d7c872bddb18ce59448065f356e0d3e8d38831c1c484b0d46e90f839d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-7fa275ee",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0034",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "开证行或保兑行对第二受益人提交的单据不得以索款金额与单价的减少，投保比例的增加，以及受益人名称与原信用证规定的受益人名称不同而作为不符交单予以拒付。",
      "quoteHash": "7fa275eeedbb75e593cb04dcd504f85fcb168d2d93583b8c19e16869177da469",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-54936c75",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0036",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "信用证未明示可议付，任何银行不得办理议付；信用证明示可议付，如开证行仅指定一家议付行，未被指定为议付行的银行不得办理议付，被指定的议付行可自行决定是否办理议付。",
      "quoteHash": "54936c75543ed1e43a399aa10085a2afb65304a2e063c64d126b04c7c774f63d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-e1dcec86",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0043",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "交单行在确认受益人交单无误后，应在发票的\"发票联\"联次批注\"已办理交单\"字样或加盖\"已办理交单\"戳记，注明交单日期及交单行名称。",
      "quoteHash": "e1dcec86e0af3f66f1050ed2cd98faa5f7cabc4a43ea850d37f1665abde62230",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-11ea4525",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0046",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四十六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "开证行或保兑行审核单据发现不符并决定拒付的，应在收到单据的次日起5个营业日内一次性将全部不符点以电子方式或其他快捷方式通知交单行或受益人。如开证行或保兑行未能按规定通知不符点，则无权宣称交单不符。",
      "quoteHash": "11ea45257e7785868e5251b89042a67614f391a34fd429e09aef0db6e1a0de6a",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-145e8fd8",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0050",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行收到单据时，应仅以单据本身为依据，认真审核信用证规定的所有单据，以确定是否为相符交单。",
      "quoteHash": "145e8fd8179dddb5b54765da03b4d0b3630cf9e0e216d553773b31d4e6d90589",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-9157b372",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0052",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "信用证要求提交运输单据、保险单据和发票以外的单据时，应对单据的出单人及其内容作出明确规定。未作规定的，只要所提交的单据内容表面形式满足单据功能且与信用证及其他规定单据不矛盾，银行可予接受。",
      "quoteHash": "9157b372fc3cc780e31f0f0baa71b160dfafb5f83bf1f77fd54c2416dd7d17d6",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "PROCESS",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-37aae165",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0057",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "银行办理信用证业务的各项手续费收费标准，由各银行按照服务成本、依据市场定价原则制定，并遵照《商业银行服务价格管理办法》（中国银监会国家发展改革委令2014年第1号）相关要求向客户公示并向管理部门报告。",
      "quoteHash": "37aae165e4d31a60e73c76ed36f7d7e0278cbad21e77407aa3df31918a98429d",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "617e9640e125d100a26f3a4778f37e0ea343ef18ddd81d8e99bb8b6610b4a872",
      "sourceId": "REG-TF-002",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/REG-TF-002.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-REGTF002-20260922-617e9640",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-06",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "REGULATORY",
      "claimType": "REGULATORY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-REGTF002-5c197a50",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-REGTF002-0058",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第五十八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法规定的各项期限的计算，适用民法通则关于计算期间的规定。期限最后一日是法定节假日的，顺延至下一个营业日，但信用证规定的装运日或服务提供日不得顺延。",
      "quoteHash": "5c197a50edfe9821f7a77aab24fcb8d128c761fd94c6032a5d571a1b05c36928",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
